    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a vast open world, <strong>Semko</strong> combines action-packed combat with creature collection. As you uncover the mysteries of ancient Obelisks, forge bonds with captured creatures who fight alongside you in strategic battles. Master an arsenal of weapons while exploring a world filled with emotional storytelling and challenging puzzles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Note: <strong>Semko</strong> is Work-In-Progress and is very early and subject to change - everything you see is not final.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Capture Creatures</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the Open World and find all kinds of Creatures to capture and fight along side you against other Creatures and Duelists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417830/extras/5bf287f2c3f7c3920e75b8e8f8324318.avif?t=1736690069\" data-has-big width=800 height=458 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Battle!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriend diverse creatures throughout your journey, each bringing unique abilities to combat. Command your companions in strategic battles against wild creatures and skilled duelists. Switch seamlessly between weapons - from swift daggers to mighty greatswords - while coordinating attacks with your newly found friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight with your Sword, Two-Hand Sword, Spear or Daggers:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417830/extras/f1a7a9e27dfb7c99a4bc103a5e66eaa0.avif?t=1736690069\" data-has-big width=800 height=458 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend yourself with Shields!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417830/extras/6fb50b9ae783b40bb0cc8503e39356c4.avif?t=1736690069\" data-has-big width=800 height=458 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your Bow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417830/extras/22ab897f3e44efde7de4ccb544327a8d.avif?t=1736690069\" data-has-big width=800 height=458 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ancient Mysteries</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the truth behind mysterious Obelisks scattered across the land. Solve intricate puzzles that guard their secrets while following a story filled with memorable characters, emotional moments, and unexpected twists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417830/extras/a453d9a9bd6a4bdc38badf041a2c1cd2.avif?t=1736690069\" data-has-big width=800 height=458 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Freedom</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move around as you wish.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb towering cliffs and structures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soar through skies with gliding gear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock flying mounts for aerial exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock or rent mounts for ground exploration</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417830/extras/7549889b36138f53cd8730b4000e5f58.avif?t=1736690069\" data-has-big width=800 height=458 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glide:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417830/extras/985102263bb922ebb91423c7f0a7c58b.avif?t=1736690069\" data-has-big width=800 height=458 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Living World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather Mushrooms, Apples, Ores, Wood and other resources to make food, upgrade your equipment, prepare survival supplies or to fulfill quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417830/extras/1666506122a5d8a4919c0bf9d6b51d53.avif?t=1736690069\" data-has-big width=800 height=458 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a vast open world, <strong>Semko</strong> combines action-packed combat with creature collection. As you uncover the mysteries of ancient Obelisks, forge bonds with captured creatures who fight alongside you in strategic battles. Master an arsenal of weapons while exploring a world filled with emotional storytelling and challenging puzzles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Note: <strong>Semko</strong> is Work-In-Progress and is very early and subject to change - everything you see is not final.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Capture Creatures</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the Open World and find all kinds of Creatures to capture and fight along side you against other Creatures and Duelists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417830/extras/5bf287f2c3f7c3920e75b8e8f8324318.avif?t=1736690069\" data-has-big width=800 height=458 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Battle!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriend diverse creatures throughout your journey, each bringing unique abilities to combat. Command your companions in strategic battles against wild creatures and skilled duelists. Switch seamlessly between weapons - from swift daggers to mighty greatswords - while coordinating attacks with your newly found friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight with your Sword, Two-Hand Sword, Spear or Daggers:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417830/extras/f1a7a9e27dfb7c99a4bc103a5e66eaa0.avif?t=1736690069\" data-has-big width=800 height=458 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend yourself with Shields!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417830/extras/6fb50b9ae783b40bb0cc8503e39356c4.avif?t=1736690069\" data-has-big width=800 height=458 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your Bow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417830/extras/22ab897f3e44efde7de4ccb544327a8d.avif?t=1736690069\" data-has-big width=800 height=458 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ancient Mysteries</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the truth behind mysterious Obelisks scattered across the land. Solve intricate puzzles that guard their secrets while following a story filled with memorable characters, emotional moments, and unexpected twists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417830/extras/a453d9a9bd6a4bdc38badf041a2c1cd2.avif?t=1736690069\" data-has-big width=800 height=458 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Freedom</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move around as you wish.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb towering cliffs and structures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soar through skies with gliding gear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock flying mounts for aerial exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock or rent mounts for ground exploration</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417830/extras/7549889b36138f53cd8730b4000e5f58.avif?t=1736690069\" data-has-big width=800 height=458 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glide:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417830/extras/985102263bb922ebb91423c7f0a7c58b.avif?t=1736690069\" data-has-big width=800 height=458 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Living World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather Mushrooms, Apples, Ores, Wood and other resources to make food, upgrade your equipment, prepare survival supplies or to fulfill quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417830/extras/1666506122a5d8a4919c0bf9d6b51d53.avif?t=1736690069\" data-has-big width=800 height=458 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
